## Exact original failure and contract

Route: `tests/integration/full-gate-20260827/preflight-repair/HANDOFF.md:90,99` and `combined-b494675c/FAILURE_ROUTING.json`, entry `tap-line-109632`, group `S3-rmdir-old-refusal`.

Exact name: `s3: named-file cleanup leaves parents and unsupported empty rmdir has no effects`.

`tests/stress/adapters/remote-safe-workflows.test.ts:58-64` unconditionally runs `await assert.rejects(fs.rmdir(nested), error => { ... })`, requiring FsError, `code === "ENOTSUP"`, `syscall === "rmdir"`, `path === nested`. Original TAP at decoded lines 109631-109645 says `not ok 16491`, `error: 'Missing expected rejection.'`, `code: 'ERR_ASSERTION'`, stack ending in that original file at `58:5`; duration 8.317542 ms. Lines 65-68's no-mutation/unchanged-directory assertions are never reached in this failing S3 test. None was revised.

Raw encoded source: `tests/integration/full-gate-20260827/combined-b494675c/evidence/canonical/test.stdout.log.data.gzbase64`. Stored SHA256 `9bcc6ef303a27cfc1749eece78b991acdb2e43b48f2990e5a089a751d91985f3`; decoded SHA256 `f51ee8beb275d7a4fd53024f57b98e614886a2ed7ae143b133d95d73e6fec3bd`, matching its EVIDENCE_MANIFEST record. Only the exact S3 raw failure was extracted for this report; no broad JSON/TAP dump is needed.

`src/contracts/filesystem.ts:34`, `src/contracts/filesystem.md:24,40,50` explicitly require `snapshotRmdir: true` to select weaker snapshot-empty marker semantics. A completed observation may authorize deleting only the exact explicit marker, never descendants. A child arriving afterward survives and may keep the logical directory visible after success; no rollback, transaction, prefix emptiness or ABA guarantee. Omitted/false flag retains the strong default. The WebDAV rule at `src/contracts/filesystem.md:88` still requires ENOTSUP absent a genuine explicitly configured atomic primitive.

`src/fs/s3/filesystem.ts:134,509-532` declares true, checks type/root/readonly/cancellation, rejects observed descendants at 523-524, verifies LIST completion at 526, requires explicit marker at 530-531, then issues exactly one marker-key DELETE at 532. `src/fs/s3/README.md:133` documents prerequisites and weaker success. Stock `src/fs/webdav/webdav.ts:769-784` refuses after empty observation without an injected atomic primitive. This scoped case shows no false capability or unsafe descendant operation.

History: original assertion blame `a645b06e1` (August 26); additive contract `ba200fec275dbda8c30cc368252cd61b6d42527c` (August 27 02:07 -0500); S3 implementation `5660248b1ff89572a6164d0b0c7bd22d03630d9b` (02:19). `tests/fs/s3/rmdir-real-service/list-oracle-review/REPORT.md:5` records the root ba200fe handoff authorizing separate additive-profile implementation. That historical authorization is not authorization to edit this fixture now.

