Copies were made with `git archive "$SHA" src package.json tsconfig.json tsconfig.build.json tests/stress/adapters/remote-safe-workflows.test.ts tests/fs/conformance/fixtures.ts tests/fs/webdav/mock.ts tests/fs/webdav/rmdir.test.ts tests/fs/s3/rmdir.test.ts tests/fs/s3/constructor-comparison.test.ts tests/fs/s3/rmdir-real-service/snapshot-profile/rmdir-profile.test.ts | tar -x -C "$ISOLATED_COPY"`.

In EACH isolated copy, the exact original command was:

```sh
TSX_DISABLE_CACHE=1 /Users/kjopek/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/bin/node --import /Users/kjopek/Workspace/safe-bash/node_modules/tsx/dist/esm/index.mjs --test --test-reporter=tap --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=^s3: named-file cleanup leaves parents and unsupported empty rmdir has no effects$' tests/stress/adapters/remote-safe-workflows.test.ts
